# This repo's own task-orchestrator.config*.json files are tracked
# deliberately -- they're the dogfood config that drives this repo's own
# Todo.md and carry no secrets (provider CLIs handle their own auth).
# task_orchestrator.cli's `init` command still gitignores this filename
# pattern by default in *other* projects that install the tool, since a
# client project's provider `env` block commonly does hold real API keys.
*.bak
state.json
orchestrator.pid
logs/
*.env
.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
.claude/settings.local.json
*.lock
task-orchestrator.config.json
